                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
        "icon": "snippet",
        "label": "Paragraph 4 • 2:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "images": [
            {
              "position": "right",
              "src": "/assets/images/extras/audiobooks/starter/young-learners-adults/the-white-oryx/paragraph-4.avif",
              "alt": "Paragraph 4 image"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "The sand makes a long yellow cloud behind the car. ’Poachers?” Mandy asks. “What do they do?” “They’re a big problem,” Abdullah says. “Usually they shoot the oryx. They sell the heads. And sometimes they catch the young oryx and sell them.” “There’s Wadi Bidbid in front of us,” Abdullah says. “I can’t see any oryx. Let’s look for tracks in the sand.”"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercises": [
        {
          "title": "1.1 Fill in the blank with the correct answer."
        },
        {
          "fillExercises": [
            {
              "card": false,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.1 ...",
                      "correctAnswer": ["..."]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "..."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
        "icon": "snippet",
        "label": "Paragraph 5 • 2:41"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "images": [
            {
              "position": "right",
              "src": "/assets/images/extras/audiobooks/starter/young-learners-adults/the-white-oryx/paragraph-5.avif",
              "alt": "Paragraph 5 image"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "They open the windows and drive slowly. ’Look! There!” Mandy says. “I can see tracks.” “You’re right,” Abdullah says. “here are the tracks of a truck, and some oryx. And look! There’s some blood in the sand here - and there. This is the work of poachers.” They follow the tracks of the truck slowly across the sand."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercises": [
        {
          "title": "1.1 Fill in the blank with the correct answer."
        },
        {
          "fillExercises": [
            {
              "card": false,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.1 ...",
                      "correctAnswer": ["..."]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "..."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
        "icon": "snippet",
        "label": "Paragraph 6 • 3:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "images": [
            {
              "position": "right",
              "src": "/assets/images/extras/audiobooks/starter/young-learners-adults/the-white-oryx/paragraph-6.avif",
              "alt": "Paragraph 6 image"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Under the tree they find an oryx with a big hole in its neck. It is dead. ’We’ve got a problem,” Abdullah says. “Look! I can see the tracks of a young oryx here. This dead oryx is its mother. But the baby oryx isn’t here.” “Can we follow the tracks of their truck in the sand?” Mandy asks. “Can we catch them?”"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercises": [
        {
          "title": "1.1 Fill in the blank with the correct answer."
