              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
        "icon": "snippet",
        "label": "Paragraph 10 • 5:48"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "images": [
            {
              "position": "right",
              "src": "/assets/images/extras/audiobooks/starter/young-learners-adults/the-white-oryx/paragraph-10.avif",
              "alt": "Paragraph 10 image"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Abdullah drives into some small trees and stops the car. He gets his gun and talks on the radio again. Mandy goes into the trees and looks at the road. “The poachers are moving again!” she says. “They’re in the truck. And the man with the gun is on the back.” “Are they driving away?” Abdullah asks. “No!” Mandy says. “Help! They’re coming back here!”"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercises": [
        {
          "title": "1.1 Fill in the blank with the correct answer."
